<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Hast thou no wound?</l><l>Yet I was wounded by the archers, spent,</l><l>Leaned Me against a tree; and rent</l><l>By ravening beasts ’round Me, I swooned:</l><l>Hast thou no wound? no wound?</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>No wound? no scar?</l><l>Yet, as the Master shall the servant be,</l><l>And pierced the feet that follow Me;</l><l>But whole? can he have followed far</l><l>Who has no wound nor scar?</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
